58 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 36 0 R
/E (The third quarter has provided valuable lessons and opportunities for improvement. While we have seen encouraging progress in several areas, our quality assessments have also highlighted gaps that require renewed attention. These findings should not be viewed merely as assessment outcomes, but as opportunities to strengthen our systems, improve patient experiences, and ultimately save lives. As we approach the close of the year, I encourage every healthcare facility to reflect on its quality performance and ask a simple but important question: What can we do better before the year ends?)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
